# Java 25 - Mandatory

## Toolchain declaration

build.gradle.kts PHAI khai bao:

\\kotlin
java {
    toolchain {
        languageVersion = JavaLanguageVersion.of(25)
    }
}
\
## Quy tac build/test

- May development co the mac dinh Java 21 - phai dung java25 (alias trong PATH) truoc khi build/test/run.
- Truoc build/test/run: chay java25 roi java -version xac nhan dung Java 25.
- Neu java -version khong phai Java 25 -> **dung va bao loi**.

## Cam

- KHONG dung --enable-preview features tru khi user yeu cau ro.
- KHONG hardcode JAVA_HOME trong code.
- Gradle wrapper tu dong download JDK 25 qua toolchain -> tin tuong toolchain, khong override.
